// qw_settings_nav — left-rail category row for the settings cluster (macro form)
//
// The settings equivalent of qw_menu_item: same main.wui nav DNA (big label,
// leading chevron, solid focus-wash, row divider) but wired for section
// switching. Clicking sets ui_settingsSection + does the `close ; open
// <submenu>` transition the settings hub uses to swap the visible sub-menu.
//
// SELECTION vs FOCUS (kept distinct from qw_menu_item on purpose): here
// `.active` = the currently-SELECTED section (persistent, cvar-driven via
// `active ui_settingsSection SECTION`), so the selected row's label + chevron
// stay $accent to mark the open tab — this is the settings-tab selection
// indicator, not a hover cue. qw_menu_item's `.active` = transient FOCUS, so
// there it switches to $bone. The two rails still share ONE chevron treatment.
//
// CHEVRON (BUG-2 fix, 2026-07-07): the resting chevron is a warm mid-grey at
// alpha 0 (0.541 0.459 0.376 0, the $boneDim rgb) — NOT the old near-black
// `0.1 0.05 0.03 0`. On a HOVERED-but-unselected row the solid accent-cyan
// focus-wash sits under the alpha-0 chevron; with a near-black rgb the leak
// read as a stark black ">" inside the row. The warm-grey rgb makes any leak a
// faint neutral instead. Same rgb is used in qw_menu_item.wui so the two rails
// render the chevron identically.
//
//   QW_SETTINGS_NAV("nav_video", "video", "Video", "video")
// Args:
//   ITEM_NAME  — unique itemDef name (string literal)
//   SECTION    — ui_settingsSection value for this row (string literal)
//   LABEL      — displayed label text
//   SUBMENU    — .wui menu name to open on click
// Tokens: $spacing_md, $line, $accent, $bone, $font_sans,
//   $spacing_menu_row_padding_v, $spacing_menu_row_padding_h
#define QW_SETTINGS_NAV(ITEM_NAME, SECTION, LABEL, SUBMENU) \
	itemDef { \
		name ITEM_NAME \
		type 1 \
		rect 0 0 1 6.5vh \
		height FIXED 48px \
		width PERCENT 1 \
		direction row \
		alignY center \
		gap $spacing_sm \
		padding $spacing_menu_row_padding_v $spacing_menu_row_padding_h \
		borderBottom 1px $line \
		forecolor $bone \
		forecolor.active $accent \
		visible 1 \
		grow 0 \
		active ui_settingsSection SECTION \
		action { setcvar "ui_settingsSection" SECTION ; close ; open SUBMENU scene } \
		\
		itemDef { type 0 rect 0 0 1vw 3vh height FIT width PERCENT 1vw text "" textalign 0 font $font_sans 24 forecolor $boneDim decoration visible 1 grow 0 } \
		itemDef { type 0 rect 0 0 16vw 3vh height FIT width PERCENT 16vw text LABEL textalign 0 font $font_sans 22 forecolor $bone forecolor.active $accent active ui_settingsSection SECTION decoration visible 1 grow 0 } \
	}
